## 🟠 Phase 2: Core E-Commerce Flow & Wiring [P1]

- [ ] **Integrate Real Frontend Stripe Payment Collection**
  - **Issue:** Checkout currently creates an order, clears the basket, and redirects without collecting credit card details.
  - **Files:**
    - [`package.json`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/package.json)
    - [`use-checkout-form.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/features/order/hooks/use-checkout-form.js#L118-L128)
    - [`CheckoutStep.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/features/order/components/CheckoutStep.jsx)
  - **Action:**
    - Install `@stripe/stripe-js` and `@stripe/react-stripe-js`.
    - Render Stripe `PaymentElement` in checkout to confirm the `clientSecret` returned by `createOrder`.
    - Clear basket only after payment confirmation succeeds.

- [ ] **Build Customer Order History UI (`/account/orders`)**
  - **Issue:** Backend has order listing, but frontend has no order view, receipt page, or tracking UI.
  - **Files:**
    - [`Order_API.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/api/order/Order_API.js)
    - [`AccountShell.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/components/account/AccountShell.jsx)
  - **Action:**
    - Export `listOrders()` and `getOrderById(id)` in `Order_API.js`.
    - Create `src/app/account/orders/page.jsx` with order cards, tracking statuses, item summaries, and receipts.

- [ ] **Wire Frontend Basket with Backend Cart API**
  - **Issue:** Backend cart service is completely unused; basket is only in `localStorage`.
  - **Files:**
    - [`Cart_API.js` (NEW)](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/api/cart/Cart_API.js)
    - [`BasketSlice.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/redux/slice/BasketSlice.js)
  - **Action:**
    - Sync cart items with `POST /server/cart/items` on user login to enable cross-device shopping persistence.

- [ ] **Pass SSR Product Data to Avoid Redundant Fetching**
  - **Issue:** Server fetches product & reviews for SEO, then renders `<ProductDetailClientPage>` which re-fetches the identical data on client mount.
  - **Files:**
    - [`products/[id]/page.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/products/%5Bid%5D/page.jsx#L101)
    - [`ProductDetailPage.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/features/product/ProductDetailPage.jsx)
  - **Action:**
    - Pass `initialProduct={product}` and `initialReviews={reviews}` props from the Server Component to the Client Component.

