## 🟡 Phase 3: SaaS Multi-Seller Marketplace Engine [P2]

- [ ] **Multi-Seller Order Routing & Line-Item Stores**
  - **Issue:** Orders do not record which seller/store owns each ordered item; sellers cannot see their sales.
  - **Files:**
    - [`Order.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/model/Order.js#L5-L53)
    - [`OrderService.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/services/OrderService.js)
  - **Action:**
    - Add `storeId` and `sellerId` to `OrderItemSchema`.
    - Implement `listOrdersBySeller(sellerId)` query in `OrderService`.
    - Build seller order management dashboard in `/seller/orders`.

- [ ] **Inventory & Stock Management**
  - **Issue:** Products have no stock limits; customers can order infinite items.
  - **Files:**
    - [`Product.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/model/Product.js)
    - [`OrderService.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/services/OrderService.js#L55-L71)
  - **Action:**
    - Add `stock: { type: Number, default: 0, min: 0 }` to `ProductSchema`.
    - Atomically check and decrement stock during order creation with MongoDB `$inc` and `$gte`.

- [ ] **Media Upload Service (S3 / Cloudinary / R2)**
  - **Issue:** Sellers must manually input external image URLs.
  - **Files:**
    - [`SellerProductForm.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Frontend/src/app/features/seller/components/product/SellerProductForm.jsx)
  - **Action:**
    - Implement image file upload handler with file validation and cloud storage upload.

- [ ] **Review Integrity & Product Rating Denormalization**
  - **Issue:** Anyone with a token can spam unlimited reviews without purchasing.
  - **Files:**
    - [`Review.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/model/Review.js)
    - [`ReviewService.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/services/ReviewService.js)
    - [`Product.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/model/Product.js)
  - **Action:**
    - Add compound unique index `{ productId: 1, userId: 1 }` in `Review.js`.
    - Verify customer has a completed order containing `productId` before accepting review.
    - Denormalize `ratingAverage` and `reviewCount` onto `Product` document on each review write.

