- [ ] **Structured Logging & Error APM**
  - **Files:**
    - [`logger.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/utils/logger.js)
  - **Action:**
    - Replace console logger with Pino/Winston for structured JSON logging and integrate Sentry for crash monitoring.

- [ ] **Prune Wasteful Database Indexes**
  - **Files:**
    - [`Store.js`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Velora/Backend/model/Store.js)
  - **Action:**
    - Remove individual btree indexes on arbitrary text fields like `storeDescription` and `storeAddress`.
